		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant, soaring falcons made of living lightning. Beings of supreme magic.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 33, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 claw +6 (2d6) or 1 lightning bolt, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to lightning. Only damaged by magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lightning Bolt</strong>. Ray of lightning hits all creatures in a far-length straight line for 3d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Storm Winds</strong>. Wings create a hurricane-strength wind within double near, ranged weapons are useless.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
